 "text": "Hello, how are things with you? That's nice of her, despite the oversight. Camping gear lent is really the friendliest. Sure, take your time. So, do you want ask her, would you like returning friend, or go along and see if she wants rent, and maybe a few other items while you' at it? Kind of depends how much gear she wants and how often she goes. If it' just night or two, renting a bag and some simple tools is very affordable. Sure. That's fair. Offer to split food and gear once you've been going a while. She'll appreciate the offer.",
